                <p class="hero-desc">Complete freight management — imports, exports, billing, real-time analytics, and multi-branch control in one platform.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-right">
                <a href="/login" class="btn-primary">
                    <i class="bi bi-rocket-takeoff-fill"></i> Get Started — Sign In
                </a>
                <a href="tel:9409309616" class="btn-secondary">
                    <i class="bi bi-headset"></i> Call: 9409309616
                </a>
            </div>
