                <div><div class="sc-label">Support</div><div class="sc-val">24 / 7</div><div class="sc-sub">Available</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="ic ic-amber"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3-fill"></i></div>
                <div><div class="sc-label">Branches</div><div class="sc-val">Multi</div><div class="sc-sub">All in one</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="ic ic-purple"><i class="bi bi-receipt"></i></div>
                <div><div class="sc-label">Invoicing</div><div class="sc-val">GST ✓</div><div class="sc-sub">Compliant</div></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="features">
            <div class="sec-header">
                <div class="sec-eyebrow">Core Capabilities</div>
                <div class="sec-title">Everything your logistics team needs</div>
            </div>
            <div class="feat-grid">
                <div class="feat-card" style="--c:#3b82f6">
                    <div class="feat-ic ic-blue"><i class="bi bi-boxes"></i></div>
                    <div class="feat-title">Consignment Management</div>
                    <p class="feat-desc">Create and track LR bookings end-to-end with real-time status updates across all branches.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feat-card" style="--c:#06b6d4">
                    <div class="feat-ic ic-teal"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3-fill"></i></div>
                    <div class="feat-title">Multi-Branch Control</div>
                    <p class="feat-desc">Operate multiple branches under one account with instant context switching and isolated data.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feat-card" style="--c:#10b981">
                    <div class="feat-ic ic-green"><i class="bi bi-cash-coin"></i></div>
                    <div class="feat-title">Billing &amp; Finance</div>
                    <p class="feat-desc">Automated freight billing, payment tracking, outstanding reports, and GST-compliant invoicing.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feat-card" style="--c:#f59e0b">
                    <div class="feat-ic ic-amber"><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i></div>
                    <div class="feat-title">Financial Year Control</div>
                    <p class="feat-desc">Manage data across multiple financial years and switch instantly without disrupting operations.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feat-card" style="--c:#6366f1">
                    <div class="feat-ic ic-purple"><i class="bi bi-shield-check-fill"></i></div>
                    <div class="feat-title">Role-Based Access</div>
                    <p class="feat-desc">Granular Admin / Manager / Staff permissions with a complete audit trail for every action.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feat-card" style="--c:#ef4444">
                    <div class="feat-ic ic-red"><i class="bi bi-bar-chart-line-fill"></i></div>
                    <div class="feat-title">Reports &amp; Analytics</div>
                    <p class="feat-desc">Job register, invoice register, outstanding reports, P&amp;L, GSTR reports and more.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-band">
            <h2>Ready to streamline your freight?</h2>
            <p>Sign in to FreightBook and take full control of your logistics operations today.</p>
            <a href="/login" class="btn-primary">
                <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right"></i> Sign In to FreightBook
            </a>
